      "content": "exactly. it's like i'm watching a movie of my own life and i just want to turn it off. there's no more \"fighting\" left in me. if the city is just a machine designed to grind us down, then maybe the only way to actually win is to stop playing the game entirely. don't you think? like, if everything is just inevitable decay anyway, why stay part of the cycle?",
